#: illness_report.gpr.py:21
msgid "Illness Report"
msgstr ""

#: illness_report.gpr.py:23
msgid ""
"Draws a genogram-style graph of the family members who are medically "
"relevant to a chosen person: ancestors, their siblings and children, and "
"that person's own descendants, showing birth/death dates, cause of death, "
"and recorded illnesses."
msgstr ""

